      - Renders as a `<select>` of `<option>`s, each submitting its `key` and showing its `value`.
      + Se rend sous forme d'un `<select>` d'`<option>`s, chacune soumettant sa `key` et affichant
      + sa `value`.
  entry .renderable
    info
        - renders a dropdown as a `<select>` of its options
        + rend une liste déroulante sous forme d'un `<select>` de ses options
  entry #name
    info
